.Dd November 18, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-SANITIZE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-sanitize
.Nd anonymized secret scanner and surgical redactor for archived codebases
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm scan
.Ar dir
.Op Fl o Ar path
.Op Fl -format Ar json|md
.Op Fl -min-confidence Ar high|medium|low
.Op Fl -include-tests
.Op Fl -exclude Ar pattern
.Op Fl -summary
.Nm
.Cm apply
.Ar dir
.Ar report.json
.Op Fl -dry-run
.Op Fl -backup-dir Ar path
.Op Fl -force
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
recursively scans a target directory (with Ruby and Ruby on Rails awareness)
for potential credentials, API keys, tokens, private keys, and sensitive
configuration files, emitting an anonymized report that never contains raw
secret values.
After operator review,
.Cm apply
surgically anonymizes, purges, or deletes only the approved findings while
verifying SHA-256 span fingerprints.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "apply"
.It Cm scan Ar dir
Recursively scan
.Ar dir
and write an anonymized JSON or Markdown report.
.It Cm apply Ar dir Ar report.json
Apply reviewed actions
.Pq Cm anonymize , Cm purge , Cm delete_file
from
.Ar report.json
to
.Ar dir .
Findings marked
.Cm review
or
.Cm ignore
are left untouched.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--min-confidence LEVEL"
.It Fl o , Fl -output Ar path
Write the scan report to
.Ar path
instead of stdout.
.It Fl -format Ar json|md
Output format for
.Cm scan :
.Cm json
(default) or
.Cm md .
.It Fl -min-confidence Ar level
Minimum confidence threshold:
.Cm high ,
.Cm medium
(default), or
.Cm low .
.It Fl -include-tests
Do not downgrade findings inside test, spec, feature, or fixture directories.
.It Fl -exclude Ar pattern
Additional path substring or glob pattern to skip (repeatable).
.It Fl -summary
Print anonymized finding counts to stderr.
.It Fl -dry-run
Preview
.Cm apply
changes without modifying files on disk.
.It Fl -backup-dir Ar path
Copy original files to
.Ar path
before mutating or deleting them.
.It Fl -force
Apply edits even if a span or file SHA-256 fingerprint changed since the scan.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage information and exit.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
Returns 2 during
.Cm apply
if one or more findings were skipped due to missing files or fingerprint
mismatches.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr secret-scan 1 ,
.Xr zdots-phi-scrub 1 ,
.Xr zdots-secret-scan 1
